  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help Imagine Scholar Students with University Fees</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We&apos;re proud 100% of our students have been accepted to university, but not always with full financial aid. NSFAS is South Africa&apos;s financial aid program, which many of our students rely on to cover university costs. Oftentimes, it can take 1-2 months to begin, so Imagine Scholar provides support for bus tickets, book money, or 1st month&apos;s rent through our Sustainable Student Opportunity Fund, a no-interest loan that any student can apply for and later repay so future youth can use as well.</narrative>
  </description>
